# Gate 0 local/mock verification requires no secrets.
# Do not create a .env file for live verification. Configure local Hardhat
# variables instead; their values are stored outside this repository:
#   pnpm --filter @veilpot/contracts exec hardhat vars set SEPOLIA_RPC_URL
#   pnpm --filter @veilpot/contracts exec hardhat vars set DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY
# Mandatory independent-wallet privacy probe for a PASS-capable live run:
#   pnpm --filter @veilpot/contracts exec hardhat vars set UNAUTHORIZED_PRIVATE_KEY
